**3-model portfolio OOS:** ~+4,982 summed (use priority router live; preclose↔open ~58% entry overlap).

**Momentum:** pre-close≤10 breakout, with-trend, **struct-hold** (no TP, H=480–720), ET ML p≥0.50, **v15 14d WF**. No reverse-signal exit.

**Dip short:** slot rip short, mech TP40/SL30/H60, ML p≥0.70 TP35/SL35/H45, scaleout labels.

Production live bot is still v15; these are v16 research lanes to preserve when extending bots or backtests.
